# Whitelist: track only selected files — ignore everything else
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements.txt
!code/
!code/**
!cluster/
!cluster/**

# Explicitly excluded (redundant with whitelist above, but kept for clarity)
.claude/
paper/
data/
logs/
**/.DS_Store

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
